    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51122" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">visco</span></b> , āvi, ātum, 1,
			v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to smear</i>, <i>besmear</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cum se inter articulorum conjunctiones usu
					commotionum viscaverit (sanies),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Theod. Prisc. 2, 21</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spirat et hinc miseri viscantur labra mariti,</span>”
				<i>are glued</i>, <i>smeared</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					6, 463</span></i>
			.</div>
